13
00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:45.640 align:middle
<c.cyan>Sophia Maier, Reporterin</c>
<c.cyan>und Autoren.</c>

14
00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:52.600 align:middle
<c.cyan>Sophia Maier, Reporterin</c>
<c.cyan>und Autorin.</c>

15
00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:57.320 align:middle
